# MaturityDispute finding route
:expect-pins 2

# The exact MaturityDispute finding route reaches its typed reader duty.
? obliged(Appeals, ReadMaturityDisputeFindingDuty, ReadMaturityDisputeFindingStandard).
# => TRUE

# The wrong recipient gains no MaturityDispute reader duty.
? obliged(WrongMaturityDisputeReader, ReadMaturityDisputeFindingDuty, ReadMaturityDisputeFindingStandard).
# => FALSE
